51% equity interest in MeinMalzeBier. In connection with the MeinMalzeBier Acquisition, we furnished Reports on Form 6-K/As on July 11,
2025 and July 31, 2025, which are incorporated by reference into this prospectus, to present (a) the audited financial statements of MeinMalzeBier
and (b) the unaudited pro forma financial information.</p><div>

