land from a third party for consideration of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AssetAcquisitionConsiderationTransferredContingentConsideration" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-20086">7,671,969</ix:nonFraction>. The concession right with a finite useful life of <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c2" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetUsefulLife" id="ixv-20087">37</ix:nonNumeric> years gives the Company
rights to operate in the designated forests in the PRC.</ix:footnote></td>
