<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">On May 26, 2023, the Company entered into a loan agreement with Honghe
County Yisa Hengtong Decoration Company to borrow $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c158" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-20122">112,678</ix:nonFraction> as a working capital loan for <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c159" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentTerm" id="ixv-20123">two years</ix:nonNumeric>. The loan is from May 26, 2023 to May
5, 2025 and bears an annual interest of <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c159" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateDuringPeriod" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-20124">1</ix:nonFraction>%. The loan was fully repaid in June 2024. On May 6, 2024, the Company entered into a new loan
agreement with Honghe County Yisa Hengtong Decoration Company to borrow $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c160" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-20125">109,600</ix:nonFraction> as working capital loan in free and due on <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c161" format="ixt:date-monthname-day-year-en" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate" id="ixv-20126">May 5, 2025</ix:nonNumeric>.
The loan was renewed to May 5, 2026.</p></ix:nonNumeric><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></p><div>

