</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Customers which contributed more than 10% of
total revenue are as below:</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><table cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px;">
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom">
