</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The following table presents operating lease
cost reported in rent expenses on the consolidated statements of comprehensive (loss) related to the Company&#8217;s leases:</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

